{"id": "EUVD-2026-108131", "enisaUuid": "e8537e6e-becf-3437-976b-939b8de3d5d0", "description": "Lotus through 0.10.2 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability in SubscriptionViewSet.get_object() that uses an unscoped queryset without organization filtering or permission checks. Authenticated users or API keys from any organization can supply another organization's subscription_id to read, cancel, update, switch plans, or modify addons, altering another tenant's billing.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T10:57:46", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T10:57:46", "baseScore": 6.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/uselotus/lotus/issues/799", "https://github.com/uselotus/lotus/pull/802", "https://github.com/uselotus/lotus/commit/1375d5140795d72251c89f47200879b9bd1d6d96", "https://github.com/uselotus/lotus/blob/0.10.2/backend/api/views.py#L754", "https://github.com/uselotus/lotus", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/lotus-through-0.10.2-cross-organization-idor-via-subscriptionviewset"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115329", "GHSA-pjmr-f3w6-46qx"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1c0953e8-4a38-3c0d-b650-c21dbeb8194f", "product": {"name": "lotus", "vendor": {"name": "filecoin-project"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.10.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "cba0a0e1-fa91-3adb-942b-d61bb6341ef7", "vendor": {"name": "uselotus"}}], "isExploited": false}